    "sanskrit": "श्रुतिविप्रतिपन्ना ते यदा स्थास्यति निश्चला।\nसमाधावचला बुद्धिस्तदा योगमवाप्स्यसि",
    "translation_en": "When your understanding, no longer confused by conflicting teachings, stands unmoving and steady in samadhi, then you will attain yoga.",
