    "verse_reference": "4.2",
    "sanskrit": "एवं परम्पराप्राप्तमिमं राजर्षयो विदुः।\nस कालेनेह महता योगो नष्टः परन्तप",
    "translation_en": "The royal sages knew this yoga, received through succession. Over a long time, O scorcher of foes, that yoga was lost here.",
