    "translation_gu": "રાજર્ષિઓએ આ યોગ પરંપરાથી મેળવી જાણ્યો. ઘણો સમય પસાર થતાં, હે પરંતપ, આ યોગ અહીં લુપ્ત થઈ ગયો.",
    "context_en": "Krishna continues the lineage theme and says that even an authentic teaching can become obscured over time. The ‘royal sages’ combine worldly responsibility with spiritual insight, fitting Chapter 3’s emphasis on action within society.",
