    "verse_reference": "4.17",
    "sanskrit": "कर्मणो ह्यपि बोद्धव्यं बोद्धव्यं च विकर्मणः।\nअकर्मणश्च बोद्धव्यं गहना कर्मणो गतिः",
    "translation_en": "One must understand action, understand wrong action, and also understand inaction. The course of action is indeed profound.",
