    "verse_reference": "9.8",
    "sanskrit": "प्रकृतिं स्वामवष्टभ्य विसृजामि पुनः पुनः।\nभूतग्राममिमं कृत्स्नमवशं प्रकृतेर्वशात्",
    "translation_en": "Taking hold of my own prakriti, I send forth this whole multitude of beings again and again, helpless under the control of prakriti.",
