    "verse_reference": "9.28",
    "sanskrit": "शुभाशुभफलैरेवं मोक्ष्यसे कर्मबन्धनैः।\nसंन्यासयोगयुक्तात्मा विमुक्तो मामुपैष्यसि",
    "translation_en": "Thus you will be freed from the bonds of action that produce good and bad fruits. With the self joined to the yoga of renunciation, liberated, you will come to me.",
