    "sanskrit": "क्लेशोऽधिकतरस्तेषामव्यक्तासक्तचेतसाम्।\nअव्यक्ता हि गतिर्दुःखं देहवद्भिरवाप्यते",
    "translation_en": "Greater is the difficulty for those whose minds are attached to the unmanifest, for the unmanifest goal is attained with difficulty by embodied beings.",
